browse_endpoints        Browse API endpoints interactively
clear_token             Clear stored CramerDB API token
create                  Create new records via API (POST)
endpoints               List available API endpoints
fetch                   Fetch any Cramer API endpoint into a tibble
fields                  List field names at an API endpoint
get_token               Get the currently configured CramerDB API token
set_token               Set the CramerDB API token for this R session
test_connection         Test connection to CramerDB API
update                  Update records via API (PATCH by id)
upsert                  Upsert records via API (PATCH if id present &
                        exists; otherwise POST)
whoami                  Check authentication status
